WEBVTT

00:05:59.263 --> 00:06:00.963
that could never disappear.

00:06:01.797 --> 00:06:05.497
Can we stand to have more relationships?

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.697
Absolutely.

00:06:06.697 --> 00:06:09.830
Will you like all your children?
Of course not.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.097
(Laughter)

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:15.030
And you know your toughest
kids are never absent.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.030
(Laughter)

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.663
Never.

00:06:18.663 --> 00:06:20.097
You won't like them all,

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:23.530
and the tough ones show up for a reason.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:26.697
It's the connection.
It's the relationships.